			"Message": "docs(Air): Restructure CHANGELOG format with consolidated version entries\n\nReformat the changelog from detailed bullet-point listings to a condensed quarterly release format. Changes:\n- Consolidate [0.3.0], [0.2.0], [0.1.0], [0.0.1] into [v2.1], [v2.0], [v1.2]\n- Trim verbose changelog entries while preserving key milestones\n- Add section headers for March 4 TODO closure and February 27 DNS resolver\n- Include module inventory listing 73 Rust modules for v2.0\n- Remove detailed dependency lists, focus on major features per quarter\n- Standardize format description with Keep a Changelog reference",
