			"Message": "docs(Air): Populate CHANGELOG with complete version history\n\nAdd comprehensive changelog documenting all notable changes across four versions:\n- [0.3.0] (2026 Q2): DevLog logging system, developer documentation, Linux features\n- [0.2.0] (2026 Q1): DNS security, Mountain client, file indexing, health checks, gRPC services\n- [0.1.0] (2026 Q1): Daemon lifecycle management, gRPC skeleton, core background services\n- [0.0.1] (2025 Q3): Initial project scaffolding\n\nThis replaces the placeholder changelog with detailed entries covering major features, refactorings, and fixes implemented throughout Air's development, following Keep a Changelog format.",
			"SHA": "2b6f0d72691b05aaf5439ee0e12e1524f8fef6aa"
