				"⣿⡇⠀⠀⠀",
				147,
				45
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Air): Introduce tag-filtered DevLog logging system\n\nReplace the standard `log` crate usage with a new `DevLog` module providing tag-filtered development logging controlled by the `LAND_DEV_LOG` environment variable.\n\nChanges:\n- Add new `Source/DevLog.rs` module with `dev_log!` macro supporting tags like lifecycle, grpc, update, indexing, config, daemon, security, metrics, extensions, etc.\n- Replace all `log::{info, warn, error, debug}` calls throughout Air with `dev_log!` macro\n- Add `LAND_DEV_LOG=all` to enable all tags, `short` mode for compressed deduplicated output, or specific tags like `LAND_DEV_LOG=lifecycle,grpc`\n- Include OTLP span emission for Jaeger/OTEL collector integration\n- Fix README.md links to use correct module paths (Updates, Downloader, Authentication)\n\nThis enables fine-grained control over logging verbosity in development while keeping the daemon silent in production by default.",
			"SHA": "54c063efd4b2785470047ebb3aea915512c4de17"
